{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫經典劇集《十月初五的月光》中，飾演「朱莎嬌」的薛家燕與飾演「萬朱莎華」的陳曼娜，劇中恩怨情仇令人印象深刻。</p><p>時隔26年，兩位殿堂級戲骨再度於幕前聚首，參演由家燕姐兒子石耀庭投資開拍的60集網絡短劇《外母嫁到（暫名）》，同場飆戲火花十足！</p><p>&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:21:26.854405+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T04:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.794455+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.794455+00:00","content_hash":"9d28f9e7cfa5c1de3d0ab6318bd055b75ee41887b5e14b266e53c6ddb078e093","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}